{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FvA8RCZKuv1795161150.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》日前盛大舉行，一眾花旦小生均悉心打扮亮相。向來氣質出眾的陳煒當晚亦以盛裝赴會，事後於社交平台分享多張台慶幕後造型寫真，並配文：「All black outfit🖤🖤🖤a bit edgy and mysterious」，以一身暗黑型格打扮化身「索爆黑天鵝」，令人眼前一亮。</p><p><p><img alt=\"alicechanwai_1795156500_4034379315227361586_1743590929.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026W93nnDeLjt1795161101.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>曝光的相片中，陳煒穿上一襲剪裁貼身的黑色V領吊帶皮革長裙，裙襬的高衩設計令內搭的黑色通花蕾絲絲襪若隱若現，加上外披的蓬鬆黑色毛草大衣隨意掛在臂彎，在冷艷型格中增添一份性感與貴氣。造型細節方面同樣一絲不苟，她將烏黑秀髮梳成光滑俐落的低髮髻，配襯精緻妝容、酒紅色指甲，以及指間多枚搶眼的藍寶石與鑽石戒指，盡顯高貴氣派。 </p><p><p><img alt=\"alicechanwai_1795156500_4034379319354522749_1743590929.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TygBtWpdRF1795161111.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"alicechanwai_1795156500_4034379327155970139_1743590929.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nsequuZhd51795161118.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T04:43:52.248086+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":307,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T03:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T07:57:15.232219+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T04:37:16.807050+00:00","content_hash":"6f08e3da5db7d7d198edb78c4cfa2b3e2929c8d96e4675ec06bed29ce4eeb987","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}